Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.41,0:02:20.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.29,0:02:24.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Your face looks like that of a man who failed at cooking instant noodles
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.33,0:02:26.46,Default,,0,0,0,,and tossed them into the sink.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.46,0:02:27.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd prefer you say that
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.54,0:02:31.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I look like someone who tried to use all his coupons,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.05,0:02:35.13,Default,,0,0,0,,only to find they've all expired.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.26,0:02:40.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess you aren't so depressed that you can't joke around.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.77,0:02:44.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Okarin, Mayushii is very disappointed in you!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.48,0:02:46.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Wh-What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.10,0:02:48.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't try to fool me!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.36,0:02:49.77,Default,,0,0,0,,You made Luka cry, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.77,0:02:51.40,Default,,0,0,0,,H-How did you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.40,0:02:53.53,Default,,0,0,0,,When I asked her to come to the lab,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.53,0:02:55.57,Default,,0,0,0,,she just started crying,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.57,0:02:57.82,Default,,0,0,0,,and when I asked her about it,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.82,0:03:00.66,Default,,0,0,0,,she said you told her she's a guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.74,0:03:03.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You heard about the D-Mail?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.83,0:03:05.42,Default,,0,0,0,,D-Mail?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.42,0:03:07.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you not to lie to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.83,0:03:11.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You should apologize to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.46,0:03:15.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Okabe...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.55,0:03:18.80,Default,,0,0,0,,you said something that awful to her?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.01,0:03:20.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait! That's not it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.60,0:03:21.97,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a reason for it—
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.97,0:03:22.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.89,0:03:25.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Come with me, assistant.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.89,0:03:26.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.89,0:03:29.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Wh-What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.44,0:03:35.90,Default,,0,0,0,,So the next D-Mail I need to erase is the one
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.90,0:03:40.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Lukako sent to her mother's pager before she was born.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.78,0:03:43.62,Default,,0,0,0,,She was really a guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.54,0:03:46.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.29,0:03:48.33,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.33,0:03:49.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It {\i1}was{\i0} true.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.96,0:03:52.17,Default,,0,0,0,,She was a guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.17,0:03:55.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Was she like Hashida?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.35,0:04:05.10,Default,,0,0,0,,That was mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.10,0:04:07.64,Default,,0,0,0,,No, she looked just like she does now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.64,0:04:08.44,Default,,0,0,0,,That's okay then.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.10,0:04:11.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, to save Mayuri,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.73,0:04:13.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I need Lukako to return to being a guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.94,0:04:16.32,Default,,0,0,0,,But you already know
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.32,0:04:20.20,Default,,0,0,0,,what the D-Mail she sent said, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.20,0:04:23.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you don't have to tell her.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.12,0:04:24.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You could just do it yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.08,0:04:28.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know the number for her mom's pager,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.25,0:04:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,,and I thought it would be better for her
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.50,0:04:35.25,Default,,0,0,0,,if I told her the truth instead of lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.55,0:04:38.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Your brilliant idea made her cry, didn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.09,0:04:41.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That's just how you are, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.55,0:04:44.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's some kind of joke, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.60,0:04:46.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That's mean!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.72,0:04:49.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1\fad(1,532)}I didn't think you'd say that to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.19,0:04:54.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You think that was a flag?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.86,0:04:56.32,Default,,0,0,0,,A flag?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.32,0:04:59.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I never said anything like,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.65,0:05:01.66,Default,,0,0,0,,"Once this battle is over, I'm getting married."
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.66,0:05:03.07,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a death flag!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.53,0:05:05.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm talking about a love flag.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.99,0:05:07.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Love?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.25,0:05:11.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Her beloved Okabe told her she's really a guy,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.75,0:05:13.71,Default,,0,0,0,,and it damaged her maiden's heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.00,0:05:17.30,Default,,0,0,0,,No way. Lukako is a guy, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.30,0:05:19.92,Default,,0,0,0,,That was in the previous worldline, right?
