Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.55,0:05:24.60,Sign1,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1219.365,322.785)\fs75\fax.05\blur2.25\frx0\fry0\frz15.038}(No Subject)
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.55,0:05:24.60,Sign1,,0,0,0,,{\pos(902.865,546.3)\fs45\blur2.25\an4\frx0\fry358\frz15.396}Dear Okabe, \NI've something important to say. \NWould you come to the shrine? \NI'm waiting. I'm waiting, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.60,0:05:24.64,Sign1,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1073.505,199.77)\fs75\blur2.25\frz14.73\fax.05}Lukako
