Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.10,0:05:28.47,Default,,0,0,0,,"I have something important to say..."
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.47,0:05:30.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Could you come to the shrine?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.65,0:05:34.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Okabe.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.23,0:05:37.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry about earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.32,0:05:40.32,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I'm sorry for crying.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.95,0:05:42.24,Default,,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.24,0:05:43.87,Default,,0,0,0,,what did you want to talk about?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.87,0:05:47.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Right. Well, I have a request.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.49,0:05:48.83,Default,,0,0,0,,A request?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.83,0:05:52.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe what you told me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.21,0:05:54.00,Default,,0,0,0,,And so, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.29,0:05:58.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll become a guy again, but in exchange...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.84,0:06:01.72,Default,,0,0,0,,p-please...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.92,0:06:03.43,Default,,0,0,0,,be my boyfriend!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.01,0:06:07.22,Default,,0,0,0,,B-Boyfriend?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.22,0:06:09.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would I be your boyfriend?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.77,0:06:10.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.10,0:06:14.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I love you, Okabe!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.40,0:06:19.28,Default,,0,0,0,,So, tomorrow, just for one day,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.28,0:06:21.74,Default,,0,0,0,,won't you be my boyfriend?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.74,0:06:25.45,Default,,0,0,0,,N-No, but you're a gu—
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.28,0:06:29.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.45,0:06:31.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll do it, so don't cry!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.16,0:06:32.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.58,0:06:35.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be your boyfriend for a day if that's really what you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.58,0:06:37.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.71,0:06:38.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you crying?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.21,0:06:41.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I'm so happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.47,0:06:46.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That was actually pretty cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.51,0:06:51.22,Default,,0,0,0,,So you'll be going out with her tomorrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.77,0:06:52.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.85,0:06:57.77,Default,,0,0,0,,A mad scientist on a date with a high school girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.77,0:06:58.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't say it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.07,0:07:01.73,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why I'm enduring the mortification
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.73,0:07:04.32,Default,,0,0,0,,of asking a mere assistant for dating advice.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.57,0:07:05.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you I'm not your assistant!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.95,0:07:09.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You're going on a date with someone, Kyouma?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.33,0:07:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Here you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.70,0:07:12.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Two iced coffees.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.70,0:07:16.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you going out with Mayushii?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.25,0:07:18.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Or with {\i1}her{\i0} ?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.33,0:07:20.92,Default,,0,0,0,,No, this is my assistant.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.17,0:07:24.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if it helps you perfect your ultimate technique,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.30,0:07:26.76,Default,,0,0,0,,you're chasing far too many girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.30,0:07:30.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Too many girls, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.43,0:07:34.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Don't say things that'll be easily misconstrued right before you leave!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.94,0:07:42.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, would you...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.65,0:07:46.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you do anything to perfect your ultimate technique?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.61,0:07:52.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I-I mean, would Hououin Kyouma do anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.41,0:07:55.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you talking about this too?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.29,0:07:56.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.79,0:07:58.50,Default,,0,0,0,,J-Just curious!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.13,0:08:02.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I was just wondering if you'd do {\i1}anything{\i0} to perfect your ultimate technique,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.04,0:08:05.80,Default,,0,0,0,,even if you already had someone you loved...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.80,0:08:07.26,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no real meaning behind it, okay?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.26,0:08:08.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you getting mad?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.47,0:08:10.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not mad!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.01,0:08:12.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyways, if that's how you're gonna act,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.26,0:08:14.31,Default,,0,0,0,,why not go on a date with her?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.31,0:08:16.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I already told you that I was going to!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.27,0:08:18.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Okarin...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.19,0:08:24.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd really appreciate it if you'd fill me in on the details.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.36,0:08:28.03,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want to know where to go on a date,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.03,0:08:31.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I've kissed dozens of girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.07,0:08:32.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll tell you everything you need to know!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.24,0:08:37.20,Default,,0,0,0,,There's Nene, Shiori, Honoka, Rinko...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.20,0:08:40.17,Default,,0,0,0,,All those girls are from games.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.17,0:08:43.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm talking about a real date.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.67,0:08:46.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard you usually go to Aoyama, Omotesandou,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.71,0:08:48.59,Default,,0,0,0,,or Nishiazabu.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.30,0:08:51.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Fashionable and trendy...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.47,0:08:53.47,Default,,0,0,0,,A premium night...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.47,0:08:54.97,Default,,0,0,0,,A special dinner...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.06,0:08:57.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It's hopeless.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.18,0:08:58.77,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a different world...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.77,0:09:02.15,Default,,0,0,0,,None of it exists in reality.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.15,0:09:03.61,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you get by denying it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.48,0:09:07.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I, Hououin Kyouma, was born
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.49,0:09:11.66,Default,,0,0,0,,with an IQ of 170, just like Isaac Newton.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.45,0:09:13.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I am a mad scientist,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.78,0:09:14.87,Default,,0,0,0,,and I prefer research over girls—
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.87,0:09:16.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Definitely a virgin!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.83,0:09:18.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.83,0:09:22.08,Default,,0,0,0,,So what about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.08,0:09:23.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you have enough dating experience
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.83,0:09:25.46,Default,,0,0,0,,to talk down to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.92,0:09:27.80,Default,,0,0,0,,See?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.80,0:09:30.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You've been so busy with studying and research
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.09,0:09:32.26,Default,,0,0,0,,that you've never been on a single date, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.26,0:09:35.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You had a lonely youth, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.10,0:09:37.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up! Is it so wrong to be a virgin?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.15,0:09:45.23,Default,,0,0,0,,With first dates, the most important thing
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.23,0:09:48.82,Default,,0,0,0,,is making yourself presentable to your partner.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.82,0:09:49.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Regarding clothing,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.99,0:09:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,there's no need to wear expensive brand names,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.70,0:09:54.07,Default,,0,0,0,,but something clean—
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.07,0:09:56.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm fine there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.16,0:09:57.83,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nothing cleaner than a lab coat.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.83,0:10:00.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Who goes on a date in a lab coat?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.25,0:10:02.87,Default,,0,0,0,,The same applies to your destination.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.87,0:10:06.09,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no need to pay for an expensive high-end restaurant.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.09,0:10:08.59,Default,,0,0,0,,The places you normally go are fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.92,0:10:10.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Places I'd normally...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.84,0:10:11.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess here won't work.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.26,0:10:13.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.88,0:10:16.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't take her somewhere gloomy like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.47,0:10:19.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I suppose the other place I frequent would be...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.89,0:10:21.06,Default,,0,0,0,,MayQueen.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.31,0:10:23.94,Default,,0,0,0,,A maid café for a first date?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.27,0:10:25.23,Default,,0,0,0,,The weapons store.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.23,0:10:27.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you buying a weapon?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.94,0:10:30.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You're just reading from a dating book,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.23,0:10:32.70,Default,,0,0,0,,so stop shooting everything down,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.70,0:10:34.20,Default,,0,0,0,,you American virgin.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.20,0:10:35.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's an American virgin?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.32,0:10:36.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Who else but you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.95,0:10:38.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah. You're a virgin too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.91,0:10:42.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, wouldn't this be a better book to read?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.96,0:10:44.96,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a dating sim walkthrough!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.96,0:10:45.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Who cares?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.96,0:10:48.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Erotic things happen on dates all the time,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.79,0:10:51.21,Default,,0,0,0,,like holding hands and stuff. That's very erotic!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.21,0:10:53.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Or when she takes your arms and presses her breasts against you,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.92,0:10:56.01,Default,,0,0,0,,that's erotic as hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.01,0:10:59.47,Default,,0,0,0,,And at the end of the date, there's a kiss.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.47,0:11:00.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it all!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.85,0:11:03.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Screw all you normalfags!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.39,0:11:09.32,Default,,0,0,0,,So it's morning, and I have no plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.40,0:11:12.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop complaining and get dressed!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.69,0:11:15.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Take off the tags.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.49,0:11:18.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Who ties their tie like that? I can't believe you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.37,0:11:20.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a mess, you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.33,0:11:22.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.16,0:11:25.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel like someone just put a chain around my neck.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.08,0:11:27.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's a handkerchief too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.21,0:11:29.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You know how to use that, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.42,0:11:33.26,Default,,0,0,0,,"I'm still waiting for you."
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.26,0:11:35.51,Default,,0,0,0,,That's for the yellow handkerchief of happiness.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.51,0:11:37.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did you learn these things?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.72,0:11:39.35,Default,,0,0,0,,That's old, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.35,0:11:40.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Yet you knew it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.93,0:11:43.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, my bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.18,0:11:44.43,Default,,0,0,0,,The correct answer is,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.43,0:11:46.94,Default,,0,0,0,,"You spread it out before she sits on a bench."
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.10,0:11:49.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.40,0:11:53.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll tail you and text you advice.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.32,0:11:54.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You're coming with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.99,0:11:56.53,Default,,0,0,0,,So is Hashida.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.82,0:12:01.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Operation Valkyria begins!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.53,0:12:03.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Why Norse mythology?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.70,0:12:08.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's critical that you're not late.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.37,0:12:11.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Be 15 minutes early at the very least.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.76,0:12:17.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Okabe!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.76,0:12:19.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.72,0:12:23.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought I left early too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.89,0:12:25.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Were you waiting long?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.89,0:12:29.19,Default,,0,0,0,,No... I just got here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.98,0:12:31.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, good...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.82,0:12:36.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Th-Then shall we go?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.49,0:12:38.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.58,0:12:50.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never seen you without a lab coat on.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.87,0:12:53.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Th-This is a date, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.84,0:12:56.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}When you're walking with a girl,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.30,0:12:58.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}you should subtly take the side with oncoming traffic.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.76,0:13:00.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Is something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.47,0:13:02.97,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.68,0:13:05.39,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.76,0:13:07.68,Default,,0,0,0,,That wasn't subtle at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.02,0:13:12.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}When a bike or car approaches, subtly protect her.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.56,0:13:14.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Did he protect her?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.57,0:13:16.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Okabe!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.74,0:13:19.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.65,0:13:21.99,Default,,0,0,0,,No, he just tripped,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.99,0:13:25.70,Default,,0,0,0,,and then a maid helped him up and gave him tissues!?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.70,0:13:26.37,Default,,0,0,0,,What on Earth...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.99,0:13:29.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Miss Makise, you seem upset.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.04,0:13:36.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I-It's nice out today, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.59,0:13:37.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.63,0:13:41.55,Default,,0,0,0,,But there are some clouds.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.55,0:13:43.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.64,0:13:51.39,Default,,0,0,0,,This cake's very good.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.60,0:13:53.69,Default,,0,0,0,,The coffee is too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.32,0:13:59.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.65,0:14:02.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I've spoken normally with her my whole life,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.53,0:14:04.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}but the moment we're on a date...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.24,0:14:05.95,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a wonderful restaurant.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.33,0:14:07.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you come here often?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.58,0:14:08.70,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.20,0:14:10.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This is bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.33,0:14:14.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}A smooth flowing conversation is imperative.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.29,0:14:17.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Th-This is actually my first time here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.75,0:14:18.67,Default,,0,0,0,,He actually answered her question?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.09,0:14:22.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Today, August 14th, is known as Patent Day
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.17,0:14:25.93,Default,,0,0,0,,in order to celebrate when the\N first patent was issued in Japan.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.93,0:14:27.64,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of conversation is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.97,0:14:30.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You sure know a lot, Okabe.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.27,0:14:32.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I-I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.90,0:14:40.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Wanna go home, Miss Makise?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.36,0:14:44.11,Default,,0,0,0,,We're just watching. We can't help at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.11,0:14:46.70,Default,,0,0,0,,No, we must see this to the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.20,0:14:49.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.45,0:14:52.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.79,0:14:55.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it boring?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.62,0:14:57.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Going on a date with me, that is.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.96,0:14:59.25,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.25,0:15:01.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Next, we'll walk around town.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.42,0:15:02.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Come with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.14,0:15:07.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Luka?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.10,0:15:11.22,Default,,0,0,0,,So hot...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.23,0:15:16.31,Default,,0,0,0,,He's just walking the whole way to Ueno and back?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.78,0:15:23.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Okabe...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.32,0:15:28.91,Default,,0,0,0,,do you remember the first time we met?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.91,0:15:29.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.49,0:15:37.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You saved me after some men with cameras accosted me.{solicited for sex or harassed? who knows?}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.08,0:15:39.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.09,0:15:45.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.88,0:15:48.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But I'm really sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.60,0:15:50.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Why are you apologizing?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.35,0:15:52.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Because...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.97,0:15:55.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I look this way, but I'm a guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.86,0:16:02.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Who cares if you're a girl or a guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.28,0:16:06.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That doesn't matter at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.11,0:16:07.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Back then,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.45,0:16:11.91,Default,,0,0,0,,what you said made me so happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.70,0:16:16.79,Default,,0,0,0,,It was those words that made me start to like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.96,0:16:20.38,Default,,0,0,0,,"That doesn't matter at all," huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.25,0:16:26.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait! Aren't those memories from when you were a guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.72,0:16:31.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I... What am I saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.76,0:16:33.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel kind of strange...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.26,0:16:36.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's just like it was with Faris.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.56,0:16:39.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}She's remembering the old worldline.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.07,0:16:47.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for today.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.65,0:16:51.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so happy... so happy...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.08,0:16:56.41,Default,,0,0,0,,so happy you were my boyfriend for today.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.41,0:16:57.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.54,0:17:00.17,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the number for my mom's pager.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.72,0:17:15.01,Default,,0,0,0,,"Meat, meat, vegetables, vegetables, meat, meat, vegetables, vegetables."
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.39,0:17:18.60,Default,,0,0,0,,If she sees this, I'm sure Urushibara's mom
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.60,0:17:21.40,Default,,0,0,0,,will assume the last one was a prank.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.48,0:17:23.31,Default,,0,0,0,,We're ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.23,0:17:28.11,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Okabe?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.95,0:17:31.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.45,0:17:36.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayushii saw Luka on a date with someone!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.87,0:17:39.00,Default,,0,0,0,,That was Okarin.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.00,0:17:41.04,Default,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.04,0:17:43.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It definitely wasn't Okarin...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.00,0:17:46.55,Default,,0,0,0,,He was wearing normal clothes,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.09,0:17:48.55,Default,,0,0,0,,and he looked like a gentleman—
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.55,0:17:49.88,Default,,0,0,0,,She's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.26,0:17:52.05,Default,,0,0,0,,It wasn't me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.05,0:17:54.85,Default,,0,0,0,,That wasn't a date with the real me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.64,0:17:56.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Okarin?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.77,0:18:01.81,Default,,0,0,0,,The date isn't over.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.69,0:18:03.94,Default,,0,0,0,,But Okabe...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.94,0:18:05.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Kyouma!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.31,0:18:06.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you forgotten my name, Lukako?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.61,0:18:11.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Guys, girls, boyfriends...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.03,0:18:13.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I was the one who was confused.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.24,0:18:16.24,Default,,0,0,0,,None of that matters!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.20,0:18:19.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I finally realized...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.24,0:18:23.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I am me, and you are Lukako, my protégé!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.17,0:18:29.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.84,0:18:32.59,Default,,0,0,0,,So bring me the dark blade, Samidare!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.63,0:18:34.59,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.18,0:18:36.22,Default,,0,0,0,,That's exactly right!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.22,0:18:37.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.60,0:18:39.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, Lukako.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.97,0:18:41.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen well.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.35,0:18:44.65,Default,,0,0,0,,The legend of this dark blade goes back
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.65,0:18:46.69,Default,,0,0,0,,to the age of Yoshitsune.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.40,0:18:50.15,Default,,0,0,0,,On the night of the full blood-red moon,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.15,0:18:54.03,Default,,0,0,0,,a traveler was lost on the roads.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.69,0:18:54.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H2E1A19&}Look at him go.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.03,0:18:55.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.41,0:18:57.45,Default,,0,0,0,,He made up with Luka.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.66,0:19:00.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess he doesn't need us anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.96,0:19:09.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Please save Mayuri.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.96,0:19:14.34,Default,,0,0,0,,The old PC you're looking for...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.34,0:19:15.88,Default,,0,0,0,,The IBN 5100?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.93,0:19:21.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Until last New Year's, it was in our storehouse,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.68,0:19:25.44,Default,,0,0,0,,but I broke it
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.06,0:19:28.19,Default,,0,0,0,,while I was cleaning the storehouse,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.61,0:19:30.82,Default,,0,0,0,,so it's all my fault!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.11,0:19:33.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Okabe, please...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.90,0:19:35.78,Default,,0,0,0,,save Mayuri!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.16,0:19:42.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I was so happy to have the chance to train with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.79,0:19:45.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Luka—
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.16,0:19:46.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Please go.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.29,0:19:50.92,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don't, I think I'm going to cry...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.96,0:19:56.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I should say the words, shouldn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.05,0:20:00.68,Default,,0,0,0,,El Psy Kongray.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.47,0:20:02.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Kongroo.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.35,0:20:06.23,Default,,0,0,0,,El Psy...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.81,0:20:13.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I really don't want to go back...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.23,0:20:15.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Because... Because...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.90,0:20:17.53,Default,,0,0,0,,If I go back,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.53,0:20:20.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll have to hide the feelings I have for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.91,0:20:26.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think I'll be able to love you if I'm a guy...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.75,0:20:28.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Lukako...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.29,0:20:31.13,Default,,0,0,0,,If I go back to being a guy,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.13,0:20:34.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to forget all about today.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.30,0:20:36.26,Default,,0,0,0,,That we went on a date...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.26,0:20:38.84,Default,,0,0,0,,That the two of us trained...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.39,0:20:43.35,Default,,0,0,0,,That I was able to hold you like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.06,0:20:47.68,Default,,0,0,0,,If I had to suffer like this,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.68,0:20:51.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I should've never wished to be a girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.56,0:20:54.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if you go back to being a guy,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.36,0:20:57.15,Default,,0,0,0,,you'll still be Lukako to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.94,0:20:59.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing will change!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.49,0:21:02.37,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.37,0:21:07.16,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter if I'm a girl or a guy, does it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.08,0:21:10.08,Default,,0,0,0,,But just for a little while,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.17,0:21:12.79,Default,,0,0,0,,please remember me
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.92,0:21:16.51,Default,,0,0,0,,as a girl...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.30,0:21:20.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll never forget.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.56,0:21:30.89,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Okabe?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.19,0:21:34.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Urushibara Luka:
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.61,0:21:37.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}the mannerisms and voice of a woman...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.07,0:21:40.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}No, more feminine than any woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.07,0:21:42.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Lukako...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.82,0:21:43.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.12,0:21:46.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you like me?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.58,0:21:47.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Wh-What are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.58,0:21:49.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.62,0:21:53.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Um... Well, I respect you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.04,0:21:58.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But... he's a guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.68,0:22:11.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Just one message left.{\i0}
